            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.23.1+2CH.23.2+2CH.23.3+2CH.23.4+2CH.23.5+2CH.23.6+2CH.23.7+2CH.23.8+2CH.23.9+2CH.23.10+2CH.23.11+2CH.23.12+2CH.23.13+2CH.23.14+2CH.23.15+2CH.23.16+2CH.23.17+2CH.23.18+2CH.23.19+2CH.23.20+2CH.23.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 23:1-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa mushanju Yehoyaada yaatuma abakuru b'Abakariiti n'ab'abarinzi b'engabo igana-igana, yaaragiira ku bamushanga omu nju ya MUKAMA; yaaragaana nabo endagaano, kandi yaabarahiriza omu nju ya MUKAMA; ku yaaherize, yaabooreka omwana w'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.9.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 9:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaabaragiira, naabagira ati: Oku nikwo muraatwaze. Kimwe kya kashatu kyanyu, abaija aha murimo ahari Sabato, barinde enju y'omugabe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kimwe kya kashatu ekindi kize aha irembo rya Suuri; kandi ekindi kigume aha irembo enyima y'abarinzi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyo bicweka byanyu byombi, eby'abaihwa aha murimo, birinde enju ya MUKAMA beehinguririize omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutyo mugume mukiikiize omugabe embaju zoona, buri muntu akwaitse eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro. Omuntu weena oraayende kutaaha omu mishorongo yaanyu, mumwite. Imwe mugume n'omugabe yaaba naashohora, kandi yaaba naataaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru b'engabo baakorabyona ebi Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaragiira, buri omwe yaareeta abashaija be ab'okwija aha murimo ahari Sabato, hamwe n'ab'okwihwa aha murimo ahari Sabato, baija ahari Yehoyaada omunyamurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.8.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 8:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omunyamurwa yaaheereza abo bakuru b'engabo amacumu n'engabo ebyabaire biri eby'omugabe Daudi bibiikirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abarinzi baayemerera, buri muntu akwaitse eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro, okuruga aha rubaju rw'enju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, okuhika aha rwa bumosho, beehinguririize eitambiro n'enju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 31:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaashohoza omwana w'omugabe, yaamujweka ekirunga aha mutwe, yaamuha Eby'okuhamya; baamuranga ku yaaba omugabe, baamushukaho amajuta, baateera omu ngaro nibagira bati: Omugabe naakaramaare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia ku yaahuriire orwari rw'abarinzi n'abantu, yaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA ahu abantu bari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 23:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe ayemereire aha rubaju rw'enyomyo, nk'oku omugyenzo gwabaire guri, n'abakuru b'engabo n'ab'amakondere bamwemereire aha rubaju, n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi nibashemererwa, nibateera amakondere. Ahonaaho Atalia yaataagura ebijwaro bye, naagira ati: Okwebumba! Okwebumba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaragiira abakuru b'engabo abaabaire nibategyeka eihe, naagira ati: Mumurabye omu ngabo, mumushohoze; oraamukurate weena, mumwite na rurara. Ahabw'okuba omunyamurwa akagira ngu arekye kwitirwa omu nju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baamutaho engaro, baamurabya omu irembo ry'embaraasi, baamuhitsya ahari nyaruju y'omugabe, baaba niho baamwitira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
